(
    title: "Universal Chaos",
    description: Some("You pilot a battle coupe through the streets of Phenix, hunting the invading Mortii spacecraft with a photon cannon that cannot fire again until its last shot connects. Clearing a wave warps you to a new sector; as the survivors thin out they grow faster and start homing, and blasting the Mortii Warlord when he surfaces pays bonus points."),
